<mxCell id="c110" value="Worked out when read, never stored: balance owed, stock, delivery status (recorded, correction pending, disputed, voided) and payment status (unpaid, in batch, part paid, paid). A payment belongs to a farmer, not to one delivery. A batch plans an amount per farmer, and buyer money does not fund it. Nothing is deleted: records are voided or corrected." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;strokeColor=#9a9a9a;fillColor=#fffbe6;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="600" y="840" width="760" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
